2026-09-04 04:26:40 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-04 04:26:40 [gemini-3.8-flash] sudo systemctl enable --now DesktopVideoHelper.service
2026-09-04 04:26:40 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-04 04:26:40 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
