2026-09-05 07:13:53 [gemini-3.8-flash]   * If the command is empty (i.e. just `#`), you could optionally switch into a dedicated shell
2026-09-05 07:13:53 [gemini-3.8-flash] prompt sub-mode similar to how `listCommand` or `creditCommand` work.
