2026-09-05 07:17:41 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Calculate column count: `Math.max(1, Math.floor(availableWidth / columnWidth))`.
2026-09-05 07:17:41 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Lay entries out vertically (standard column-major order like `ls -C`) or horizontally.
