2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] permissions in two distinct places depending on whether you mean VS Code / the CLI agent
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] permissions, or Deno's internal runtime permissions.
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
