2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] 1. In That Specific Agent Config File
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] To allow the agent/extension to run `deno` commands non-interactively without prompting for
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] approval, add shell permission entries under `"permissions"."allow"`:
