2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] 2. If You Mean Fixing Deno in VS Code Itself
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] If you are trying to fix Deno language server support, module resolution, or PATH detection inside
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] VS Code, that must go into VS Code's standard `settings.json`
2026-09-05 07:51:34 [gemini-3.8-flash] (`~/.config/Code/User/settings.json` on Linux):
