2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] If it is installed, the application ID is typically `org.godotengine.Godot`. You can run the
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] headless command through Flatpak directly:
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] flatpak run org.godotengine.Godot --headless -s res://export_schema.gd
