2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] Making the `godot` Command Available in Terminal
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] If you prefer using `godot` directly, you can create a shell alias or a wrapper script.
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Option A: Shell Alias*
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] Add the following line to `~/.bashrc` or `~/.zshrc`:
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] alias godot='flatpak run org.godotengine.Godot'
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Option B: Symlink / Wrapper Script*
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] Create a script in `~/.local/bin` (ensure `~/.local/bin` is in your `PATH`):
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] cat << 'EOF' > ~/.local/bin/godot
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] #!/bin/sh
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] exec flatpak run org.godotengine.Godot "$@"
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] EOF
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] chmod +x ~/.local/bin/godot
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] Standalone Binary Alternative
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] If you prefer to avoid Flatpak's sandboxing (which can sometimes complicate accessing files outside
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] your home directory), official standalone Linux binaries are single executables that require no
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] installation. They can be downloaded from the official website or repository releases, marked
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] executable with `chmod +x`, and placed directly in `~/.local/bin/` or `/usr/local/bin/`.
2026-09-05 08:31:16 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
