2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] Why the Menu Bar / "About" is Missing
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] In modern KDE Konsole releases, the traditional menu bar is frequently hidden by default.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Toggle the Menu Bar: Press `Ctrl + Shift + M`. This toggles the top menu bar
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] (File, Edit, View, Settings, Help/About) on and off.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Alternatively, right-click anywhere inside the terminal window to open the context menu, or look
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] for the hamburger menu button (three horizontal lines) in the upper-right corner of the window.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] How to Change the Color Scheme in Konsole
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] Once the menu or settings are visible:
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 1. Using the Menu Bar:
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Go to Settings → Configure Konsole... (or right-click → Configure
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] Konsole...).
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Select Profiles on the left sidebar.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Select your active profile (usually marked with a checkmark) and click Edit.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Switch to the Appearance tab.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Choose an existing color scheme from the list, or click Get New... to download
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] additional community themes.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Click Apply and OK.
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] 2. From the Configuration Files Directly:
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Konsole profile definitions are stored under `~/.local/share/konsole/` (ending in `.profile`).
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash]    * Color schemes are stored as `.colorscheme` files in `/usr/share/konsole/` and
2026-09-18 09:47:04 [gemini-3.8-flash] `~/.local/share/konsole/`.
