2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] `/mnt/temp_check`:
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] grep "temp_check" /etc/fstab
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] If duplicate entries are present, you can open `/etc/fstab` in your preferred editor with `sudo`
2026-09-18 11:00:09 [gemini-3.8-flash] and remove the extra lines.
