2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] sudo tar -C /srv/http/grid -cf - . | sudo tar -C /mnt/grid26 -xf -
2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] • (This will run silently and return your terminal prompt when finished.)*
2026-09-18 11:06:24 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
