2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] The document serves as an expansive reference catalog combining orthographic systems, character
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] sets, technical standards, and domain-specific taxonomies. Notable areas covered within the
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] specification include:
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Linguistic and Script Systems: Diverse scripts ranging from ancient writing systems
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] (Linear B, Glagolitic, Phoenician, Cuneiform/Akkadian, Ogham, Cherokee, Vai) to modern
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] orthographies (Te Reo Māori, Greek, Latin, Hebrew), complete with character mappings, syllabaries,
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] and ideograms.
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Character Encoding and Typography: Comprehensive listings of Unicode sub-ranges,
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] fullwidth/halfwidth variants, mathematical alphanumerics, alchemy symbols, sextants/quads for
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] legacy computing, Braille matrices, and ASCII/ANSI control definitions.
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Technical Specifications: Historical milestones for semiconductor optoelectronics (LEDs
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] and laser diodes), Windows virtual-key codes (`VK_*`), and RIFF metadata FourCC mappings.
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Geographical and Infrastructure Data: Sovereign states, disputed and defunct political
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] entities, global submarine communications cable landings/capacities, and public cloud availability
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] zones (AWS and Alibaba Cloud).
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Taxonomies and Ontologies: Culinary classifications (flatbreads and pancakes), musical
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] scales with interval sets, morphological affixes (`pheme`), citation style requirements, persistent
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] identifier regular expressions, and formal schema declarations (`schema` / `types`).
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] Please let me know if you would like to run validations, perform structural transformations,
2026-09-18 14:47:45 [gemini-3.8-flash] inspect specific subsets, or cross-reference any entries.
