2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.3 gemini-3.8-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.001 4.782KB 1.85s
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] You can redirect the output of `journalctl` into a text file using standard shell redirection
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] (`>`).
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] To dump the entire log from the current boot:
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] journalctl -b --no-pager > journal.txt
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] • (The `--no-pager` flag ensures the output is printed directly without piping through `less`,
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] preventing formatting issues in the resulting file.)*
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] Other useful variations:
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Everything in the system journal (all boots, can be very large):
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash]   journalctl --no-pager > journal.txt
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Only logs related to your mount point from the current boot:
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash]   journalctl -b -u mnt-grid26.mount --no-pager > journal.txt
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Only errors and critical messages from the current boot:
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash]   journalctl -b -p err --no-pager > journal.txt
2026-09-18 15:41:39 [gemini-3.8-flash] 
