2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] I’ve reviewed the shared files. A few observations on the dsptool stack:
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] 
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] • Architecture*
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Native C++ backend (`fit3.cpp` entry point) with an HTTP server, JSON-RPC dispatch, Redis/Valkey
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] integration, and a web frontend served from `web/`.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Header-heavy implementation: most logic lives in `.h` files included directly.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Cross-platform scaffolding with `#ifdef __APPLE__`, `__linux__`, `_WIN32` guards.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] 
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] • Notable subsystems*
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Audio: ALSA capture/playback and a software synth (`synth.h`).
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Graphics: DRM/KMS + GBM + EGL path (`drmdisplay.h`), plus a framebuffer snapshot path.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Networking: HTTP/IPv4/IPv6 server, Redis/Valkey client, socket wrappers.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Hardware interfaces: serial/udev, V4L2 video, Bluetooth SDP, NMEA 2000, CEC.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] 
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] • Code-quality notes*
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Several macros invoke `raise(SIGSTOP)` on error (e.g., `FDErrorCheck`, `ErrorCheck`). That may be
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] intentional for debugging, but it will halt a production server.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - There is a lot of global/static state (`stereo`, `HttpSocket4/6`, `infoCache`, etc.).
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - `alloca` is used in several ALSA/DRM paths.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - `Process::start` uses `vfork` + `execvp` without post-`_exit` error handling.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Some files are stubs or nearly empty (`ramis.h`, the `snapshotFB` override in `fit3.cpp`).
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] 
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] • Web side*
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - Multiple HTML shells (`dspdevice`, `dspstudio`, `dsplab`, `dsptool`, `dspdesktop`, `dspmap`)
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] reference a large set of `dspjs/` and `wirejs/` scripts that weren’t included in this share.
2026-09-18 19:09:03 [kimi-k2.7-code] - `notes.txt` contains useful emoji/icon reference and CSS snippets.
