2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] Looking at `dspwiki.js` (and its Redis-backed storage via `headless.h`'s `redis.run` RPC), here's a
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] summary in the same style as the existing DSP Components list in `dsptool.md`, ready to
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] slot in as item 16 (and added to the Table of Contents):
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 16. wiki
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] • Summary:* A Redis-backed markdown wiki editor and viewer. Pages are addressed by key,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] fetched/saved via `GET wiki.<key>` / `SET wiki.<key>` through the generic `redis.run` RPC method,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] and rendered client-side into HTML. Supports tables, indented code blocks, fenced code blocks
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] (plain, `html` passthrough, `csv`, and `latex` via KaTeX), inline live preview, and a basic
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] in-browser editor with an emoji picker panel.
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] • Globals:* `wiki`, `wikiDiv`, `wikiTools`, `wikiHome`, `wikiRefresh`, `wikiAddress`,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] `wikiEdit`, `wikiDebug`, `wikiPreview`, `wikiSave`, `wikiEmoji`, `WikiAnchors`, `homeWiki`,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] `goWiki`, `onWikiGet`, `onWikiWrite`, `onWikiAddress`, `onWikiEdit`, `onWikiDebug`,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] `onWikiPreview`, `onWikiSave`, `onWikiRun`, `onWikiEmoji`.
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] • Sturdiness:* Core read/save/preview loop is solid and simple — plain string keys in Redis
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] make it easy to inspect and back up externally. However, several rough edges remain: the emoji
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] picker's data fetch (`nitrojs/json/emoji.json`) is commented out, so the panel currently renders
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] empty; `back()` navigation is non-functional (`this.history` is never populated, and the method
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] reads the global browser `history` object rather than the instance field); `run()` is a placeholder
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] stub that scans lines for a leading digit but performs no execution; and `WikiAnchors` (hash-based
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] navigation) is hardcoded `false`, so deep-linking via `#wiki.<key>` in `onHash()` (`dsptool.js`) is
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] currently the only working navigation path — the toolbar's `Home` button does not update the URL
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] hash. Currently only mounted on the Lab page (`dsplab.html`); other shells (Desktop, Studio,
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] Device, Map, Sandbox) omit the `#wiki` div entirely, so this instrument is Lab-only for now.
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:21:21 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
