2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] Penetration Testing Plan — dsptool / fit3 Web Service
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] • Target: `fit3` HTTP(S)/JSON-RPC service (native/fit3.cpp, http.h, headless.h) +
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] static web app (web/.html, dspjs/*)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] • Prepared for:* internal security review prior to public/production exposure
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] • Scope note:* This plan assumes testing against a system you own/control, in a
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] non-production or explicitly authorized environment. Coordinate maintenance windows before running
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] load/DoS tests.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 1. Objectives
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Validate that the JSON-RPC surface at `/api` cannot be abused to read/write arbitrary files,
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] execute arbitrary Redis commands, or spawn/control processes without authorization.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Confirm session/token handling cannot be predicted, replayed, or hijacked.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Confirm static file serving cannot be used for path traversal, information disclosure, or
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] resource exhaustion.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Assess resilience of the connection-handling model (per-thread blocking I/O, sleep-based
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] throttling) to DoS.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Identify hardcoded secrets, weak crypto usage, and transport-level exposure (plaintext HTTP).
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 2. Scope
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] • In scope*
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - `hostIPv4` / `hostIPv6` listeners on port 8083 (http.h)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - `/api` JSON-RPC dispatcher (`InvokeRPC`, `parseRPC` in headless.h)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Static asset serving under `StaticPath` / `GridPath`
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Redis/Valkey backend as reached through the RPC layer (not direct network access, unless
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] explicitly authorized separately)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Session/event polling mechanism (`sys.tick`, `sys.info`, `EventSink`)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Process bridging (`sys.connect`, `sys.write`, `Process` class)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] • Out of scope (unless separately authorized)*
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Direct network access to Redis/Valkey port 6379
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - ALSA/DRM/video/bluetooth native subsystems (not currently wired to `InvokeRPC`, but re-check at
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] test time)
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - Physical/hardware access paths
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 3. Methodology Phases
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] Phase 1 — Reconnaissance & Mapping
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
