2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - `redis.run` — this method passes the client-supplied `params->string` almost directly
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] into `redis.runRedis`/`RedisContext::run`, which itself parses quoted args and forwards to
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] `redisCommand`/`redisCommandArgv`. Treat this as effectively an unauthenticated Redis command
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] execution proxy unless something upstream restricts it. Test:
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - `FLUSHALL`, `CONFIG SET`, `EVAL` (Lua sandbox escape attempts), `SCRIPT LOAD`, `DEBUG`,
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] `SHUTDOWN`.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - Command-injection via crafted quoting in the argument parser (`parseCommand`) — test unbalanced
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] quotes, embedded nulls, backslash edge cases.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - Blind command chaining via `redis.process` (iterates an array of "commands" that are actually
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] treated as blob keys — confirm they can't be abused to enumerate/read arbitrary blob keys belonging
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] to other uploads).
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - `redis.put` — uploads content, hashes it, stores as `blob.<hash>`, and records an
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] `upload.<hash>` hash-set entry with attacker-controlled `name`/`type`/`size` fields inserted
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] unescaped into a Redis command string (`setHash`). Test for Redis protocol injection via these
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] fields (e.g., embedding `\r\n` sequences or additional HSET arguments in `name`/`type`).
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] - `fs.folder` / `fs.file` — take a raw `path` string with no path-traversal or
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] allow-listing check visible (unlike the static GET handler, which explicitly rejects `..`).
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] Test:
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - `../../../../etc/passwd`, absolute paths (`/etc/shadow`), symlink traversal.
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - Confirm whether these RPC methods are reachable pre-authentication (they appear to require no
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] session token at all).
