2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] buffer (`MaxRequest`). Test:
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5]   - Content-Length larger than buffer, negative/overflowed values via `longValue()` (uses `strtol`,
2026-09-18 19:47:39 [claude-sonnet-5] no bounds/error check) feeding the `while(n<contentLength)` read loop.
