2026-09-18 22:25:30 [claude-sonnet-5] • Why this helps your fd issue specifically:*
2026-09-18 22:25:30 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-18 22:25:30 [claude-sonnet-5] Once you have the PID in the log, you can check its actual limits directly instead of guessing:
2026-09-18 22:25:30 [claude-sonnet-5] 
