2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] Based on what you've mentioned (Gwenview, Falkon), your desktop environment is KDE Plasma —
2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] currently Plasma 6 if you're on an up-to-date Arch install.
2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] Checking Your Plasma Version
2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 09:51:32 [claude-sonnet-5] 
