2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] Confirmed: Where the Tainted Canvas Error Actually Fires
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] In `wire_core.js`, `ShareTexture()` is the exact call site:
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] function ShareTexture(gl,image){
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	if(image.src in SharedTextures){
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		const tc=SharedTextures[image.src];
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		tc.count++;
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		return tc;
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	}
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	const texture = gl.createTexture();
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	gl.bindTexture(gl.TEXTURE_2D, texture);
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	gl.texImage2D(gl.TEXTURE_2D, 0, gl.RGBA, gl.RGBA, gl.UNSIGNED_BYTE, image);
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	...
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] This is fed by `Shape.loadTexture()`, called from `addTileShape`/`addStaticShape` in
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] `wire_graphics.js`, using `tile.scratch` — the 2D canvas built in `TopoTile.createScratch()`
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] (`wire_topo.js`). So the full chain is:
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] HtmlImage (cross-origin jpg) → drawImage onto tile.scratch → scratch used as WebGL texture → texImage2D throws
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] Good to have this pinned down precisely for next time.
