2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] tainted-canvas error will likely come straight back — since this `Image` never opts into CORS mode.
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] Worth adding `image.crossOrigin="anonymous";` here now while it's fresh, rather than rediscovering
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] it later.
