2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] Curiosity: `TextureLoader`'s Non-Standard crossOrigin Value
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] class TextureLoader{
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 	constructor(path,handler){
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		...
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		const image=new Image();
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 		image.crossOrigin="dsptool";
