2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] `"dsptool"` isn't a valid `crossOrigin` value (valid values are `"anonymous"` or
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] `"use-credentials"`). It happens to work only because the HTML spec's invalid-value-default
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] for this attribute falls back to `"Anonymous"` — so this is functioning by accident rather than by
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] design. Recommend just writing `"anonymous"` explicitly so it's not confusing to the next reader
2026-09-20 10:47:13 [claude-sonnet-5] (or future you).
