2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] Steps to purge via Cache Tag in the Bunny CDN Dashboard
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 1. Log in to your Bunny.net account.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 2. Go to your Pull Zone (the one serving `wiredjs/`).
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 3. Open the Caching tab.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 4. Look for the Cache Tags or Purge Cache section.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 5. If you're purging by tag, there should be a field to enter the tag name (e.g.,
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] `wiredjs`) and a Purge button next to it.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 6. Confirm the purge — Bunny will invalidate all cached objects associated with that tag across
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] edge nodes.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] Important prerequisite
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] For tag-based purging to work, your origin server must already be sending the tag header on the
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] responses for files under `wiredjs/`, e.g.:
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] CDN-Cache-Tag: wiredjs
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] Without that header being set at origin (or via an Edge Rule), Bunny has nothing to purge by tag —
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] there'd be no files associated with `wiredjs`.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] If you haven't set tags yet
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] If you just want to flush that folder right now without tags, you can also:
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] - Go to Caching → Purge Cache
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] - Enter the specific URL pattern (e.g., `https://yourzone.b-cdn.net/wiredjs/*`)
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] - Click Purge
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] That does an immediate wildcard purge without needing tags at all.
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] 
2026-09-20 11:46:27 [claude-sonnet-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
