2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] that build. GitHub is owned by Microsoft, but its presence does not turn Code - OSS into the
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] official Microsoft VS Code distribution.
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] 
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] You can check which Arch package supplied it with:
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] 
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] 
