2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] 
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] Typically:
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] 
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] - `code` — Arch’s Code - OSS build
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] - `visual-studio-code-bin` — Microsoft’s official branded build, commonly installed from the AUR
2026-09-22 08:56:37 [gpt-5.6-sol] - `vscodium` — community build intended to remove Microsoft branding and telemetry defaults
