2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Detailed HTTP Response Info: Inspecting the exact status code (`response.status`), status
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] text (`response.statusText`), and tracking identifiers (such as the `CDN-RequestCountryCode` or
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] server headers, if returned).
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Response Body Content: While a standard purge often returns an empty body or a simple
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] boolean/JSON acknowledgement, parsing and printing the raw body text or structured JSON can verify
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] the exact confirmation message returned by Bunny.net.
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] • Timestamp Logging: Emitting an ISO timestamp indicating exactly when the cache
2026-09-23 07:08:10 [gemini-3.8-flash] invalidation completed.
