2026-09-28 10:42:50 [deepseek-flash] EventServer();` at top level, and `EventServer`'s constructor does `new Worker(...)`. Importing the
2026-09-28 10:42:50 [deepseek-flash] whole file into the baker will attempt a nested worker with a bad relative path. Either guard that
2026-09-28 10:42:50 [deepseek-flash] one line or carve out a small `wire_dig.js`. The doc recommends guarding.
