2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] Yes — the baker is the only place it can work. `post()` detaches `topo`/`diff`/`ground`, so the dig
2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] has exactly one window: after the merge, before `postFlora`. That window is inside the worker.
