2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] `outlines` is the array of `drawing.outlines[start+i]` vertex arrays. Plain structured clone, no
2026-09-28 11:36:24 [deepseek-flash] transfer list. `depth`/`border` sent from main so the knobs stay in `wire_grid.js`.
