2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] So there are two flora generators running (worker `FloraPen=3` at count 128, main at count 256) and
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] neither shows. The worker's is wasted work, the main one is empty.
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] • Pick one.* Cleanest is to drop the main-thread generation and use the worker's, which
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] already respects `FloraPen`:
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
