2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] const floraSurface=tile.floraSurface;
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] const floramesh=layer0.addTileShape(floraSurface,tile.basemap,tile.scratch,origin);
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] tile.floramesh=floramesh;
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] If you'd rather keep main-thread flora, fix `TopoFloraSurface` (`15` → `c`, and pass a `floraMin`).
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 4. `ScratchRes` clip mismatch
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] `wire_graphics.js` now has `let ScratchRes=1024;`, and `TraceClosedOutline` uses it as the clip
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] box:
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 13:18:09 [deepseek-flash] 
