2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] `wire_graphics.js` — walls on, with two behaviour changes
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] `build_walls_geom=true` now generates wall geometry, which is a new feature live. Alongside it,
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] `walledSpiral` changed:
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] // base ring
2026-09-29 19:41:01 [deepseek-flash] const g0=topo.pickElevation(px,py);   // was pickGround
