2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] `!tile.tilemesh && tile.hasLoaded()`, so a returning unmeshed tile rebuilds from retained data with
2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] no fetch.
2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] `hasLoaded()` stays true through unmesh — `ready`, `heightmap`, `floraSurface`, `imageCount`,
2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] `drawingCount` are all untouched by `flushMesh`.
2026-09-29 20:30:46 [deepseek-flash] 
